  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>The ASICS GEL-NYC blends early-2000s running design with everyday wear versatility. A mesh and suede upper references the GEL-NIMBUS 3 and GEL-MC PLUS V, while rearfoot and forefoot GEL cushioning help soften impact through long days on your feet. Underfoot, GEL-CUMULUS 16 tooling adds a flexible, responsive ride that works for commuting, walking, and casual rotation wear.</p><p>ASICS® GEL-NYC features:</p><ul><li>Rearfoot and forefoot GEL cushioning helps absorb impact.</li><li>GEL-CUMULUS 16 tooling supports flexibility through each stride.</li><li>Mesh underlays improve airflow across the upper.</li><li>Suede overlays add structure and durability to the build.</li><li>Rubber outsole delivers traction on multiple surfaces.</li></ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-NYC - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Cream/Oyster Gray</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1201A789-103</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoe